cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use kgdiff in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "kgdiff: git diff for knowledge graphs"
abstract: >-
  kgdiff compares two versions of a knowledge graph (RDF, OBO or JSON graph formats). It matches
  nodes across versions, classifies what changed (renames, merges, splits, hierarchy moves,
  retargeted relations), groups the changes into reviewable hunks with an invertible delta, and
  shows them on one stable layout in a web component, a command-line tool and HTML reports.
authors:
  - alias: iiwish
repository-code: "https://github.com/iiwish/kgdiff"
license: MIT
version: 0.12.0
keywords:
  - knowledge graph
  - ontology
  - diff
  - RDF
  - OBO
  - visualization
  - code review
